OL,3,AExcitement grows for new ACOTAR book
OL,4,
OL,5,F"It's the escapism, it's a way for
OL,6,Fpeople to escape from every day life.
OL,7,FSo many people, especially young women,
OL,8,Fsee themselves in these characters and
OL,9,Fthere are so many really strong
OL,10,Fmessages about empowerment and finding
OL,11,Fstrength," party organiser Holly
OL,12,FFellows, from Redditch, said.
OL,14,FThe fantasy series, written by American
OL,15,Fauthor, Sarah J. Maas, is popular with
OL,16,Freaders across the world.
